{"id":"type-function-graph","html":"<section id=\"features\"><h2>题型特征</h2><ul><li><p>给出含平移、对称或绝对值的表达式，要求画图或判断图像选项。</p></li><li><p>只给原函数示意图时，依据点的对应关系变换，不能自行补造解析式。</p></li><li><p>借助图像分析方程或不等式时，先确定临界点，再核对严格性及端点取舍。</p></li></ul><div class=\"feature-confuse\"><p class=\"feature-tag\">别和它混淆</p><ul><li><span>主目标仅为全部输出的范围，图像只是辅助方法</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"problem_type\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/type-function-range/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>求函数的值域</a></li></ul></div></section><section id=\"choose\"><h2>怎么选方法</h2><div class=\"choose-rule\"><p>用<a data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/rule-function-graph-method/\">函数图像题的选法判断</a>来选：满足哪一条，就可以用对应的方法；几条同时满足时，挑顺手的。</p><ul class=\"branch-list\"><li><span>含绝对值的一次式，可由基本图建立点的对应。</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-function-graph-transform/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>图像变换法</a></li><li><span>含绝对值的多项式，要求画出完整图像。</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-absolute-piecewise-graph/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段作图法</a></li><li><span>已知绝对值函数，要求解与水平线比较的不等式。</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-piecewise-graph-inequality/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段图像解不等式法</a></li></ul></div><h3>可选用的方法</h3><div class=\"choose-methods\"><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-function-graph-transform/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>图像变换法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>固定有理系数的 |ax+b|+c（a≠0），或有两个有理零点的 |p(x)|+c（二次式、全实数域）及题给水平/竖直平移；原选项证据须足以唯一判断。 也支持原图为展示部分单调、横轴交点有明确标记的示意曲线及 f(±x+b)；全部选项须有可核对的同类事实。</p><p>根据解析式或原图中可核对的特征，确定点的移动，再核对原选项。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-absolute-piecewise-graph/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段作图法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>固定有理系数、至多二次的 |p(x)| 及一个区间。</p><p>按绝对值内的正负分段，逐段确认表达式、区间、方向和端点后作图。</p></article><article class=\"choose-method\"><h4><a class=\"node-chip\" data-kind=\"method\" data-node-link href=\"/knowledge/method-piecewise-graph-inequality/\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>分段图像解不等式法</a></h4><p class=\"choose-when\"><strong>适合什么题：</strong>固定有理系数、至多二次的 |p(x)| 及一个区间。</p><p>用水平线确定交点，在各段范围内解不等式并核对端点。</p></article></div></section><section id=\"examples\"><h2>说明与题例</h2><article class=\"example\"><h3>1. 绝对值函数平移选图</h3><p class=\"problem\">判断 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=|x-1|+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> 的大致图像。</p><ol><li>由 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y=|x|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span> 向右平移 1，再向上平移 1。</li><li><span class=\"math-tail\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>↦</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,0)\\mapsto(1,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↦</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，</span>左侧递减、右侧递增；核对原选项的标注。</li></ol><p class=\"source\">函数的表示法 B09</p></article></section>"}
